 "story": "Far enough. \nNo reason to keep going. \nGround feels right here.\n\nWind through grass. Dust and pine. \nTree line thinning. \nNo pull. No reason to turn.\n\nPeace, maybe- \nor just the quiet left behind \nonce everything else lets go.\n\nThinking I might just stay here, \nlong enough to- \nand see what remains.",
